    "chunk_text": "Eastseaxe & \u00d0urh Albinus swi\u00f0ost ic ge\u00f0ristl\u00e6hte \u00fe\u00e6t ic dorste \u00feis weorc ongynnan, & eac mid Danieles \u00fe\u00e6s Fela he me s\u00e6de ymbe Su\u00f0seaxe & embe Westseaxe; & eac ymbe Wiht \u00f0\u00e6t igland swy\u00f0ost he me & \u00feurh Cedde \u00feone arwur\u00f0an Myrcna bisceop & Ceaddan ymbe Myrcna \u00feeode & Eastseaxena; & eac \u00dea \u00feing \u00fee on Eastenglum gewordene w\u00e6ron, sume we \u00fea of ealdra manna gewritum o\u00f0\u00f0e s\u00e6gene & \u00fe\u00e6t on Lindese geworden w\u00e6s ymbe Cristes geleafan, \u00feurh gesegene \u00f0\u00e6s arwur\u00f0an biscopes & eac \u00fe\u00e6t we on Nor\u00f0anhymbrum geacsedon ymbe Cristes geleafan o\u00f0 \u00f0ysne andweardan d\u00e6g, \u00d0\u00e6t ic be \u00f0am halgan f\u00e6der Cu\u00f0byrhte wrat o\u00f0\u00f0e on \u00feysse bec o\u00f0\u00f0e on o\u00f0re, \u00fea d\u00e6da his lifes, sume & \u00feone leornere ic nu eadmodlice bidde & halsige, gif he hw\u00e6t ymbe \u00f0is on o\u00f0re wisan gemete o\u00f0\u00f0e.",
